  "description": "CelebrateIT is a production-grade wedding planning platform built around one core idea: **a bride is planning two weddings, not one.** Many South African brides hold a traditional celebration and a white wedding — separate dates, separate cities, each with its own budget, guest list, vendors, and checklist. Every other planning tool assumes a single wedding; CelebrateIT is built specifically for both.",
